  "ALL_TEXT": "88 INT. VEDA'S HOUSE - DAY\nVEDA tries to unlock the door, but realizes his roommate is\ninside, and rings the bell.\nBHANU\nRey!! aekkadikelpoyaavu raa...\nkukkanesukuni vurantha shikaarla?\nVEDA\nAlmost alantidhey..\nThe trio enter the house. BHANU stares at SULOCHANA, and\ndoesn\u2019t even notice GOVARDHAN.\nBHANU\nEvaru ee santoor sundhari?\nGOVARDHAN looks around and sits in a chair. He notices a few\nundies right next to the chair and he jumps out (of the\nchair). GOVARDHAN sees a nude poster right next to him on the\nwall, covers his eyes with his hands and mutters to himself.\nBHANU\nOh ... ekkado choosinattundhi...\nVEDA\nT.V. lo choosuntaav\nBHANU\nT.V. lo naa..?\nNews of SULOCHANA and GOVARDHAN being suspects screens on the\nTV. This scares BHANU.\nBHANU\naah..! eevida..eevida baba ni\nchampindi.. kadhu..\nGOVARDHAN\nBachelor room antey dharidhram,\nchandaalam\nBHANU screams out of fright seeing GOVARDHAN.\nBHANU\nIthanu aa rendo hanthakudu\nkadhu.....\nBHANU soon thinks of the worst.\nBHANU\nRey ilaa professional killers ni\nchairopakka vesukuni vochi\nchairupakkanaa naa dead body\npadesthaava???\nVEDA laughs\nBHANU\n...i am very sorry raa....nee dabbu\nneeku ichesthaanu...inka eppudu\ntaagi room ki raanu...assalu ee\nroom lone undhanu..nannu champoddhu\nraa...\nVEDA smirks\nBHANU\nEnti ee city lo kudaa undakudadha??\nsarey maa uruvellipoyi bellam\nammukunta.\nVEDA puts his arm around BHANU's shivering shoulder.\nVEDA\nMoodo vaadevado inka theliledhu\nkadhu..\nBHANU\nAa moodo vaadu?\nVEDA\nAdhey poddhunna murders chesina\nvaadu\nBHANU\nTheeliledhura\nVEDA laughs\nBHANU\nAnte nuvvenaa\nBHANU is terrified\nBHANU\norey sorry raa, naannu vadiley\nraa..\nBHANU runs towards the door, before VEDA manages to outrun\nhim and close it.\nBHANU\nEe pasivaadini champaddam paapam\nraa..\nVEDA\nmundhu koorcho...\nBHANU sits down, obedient like a school boy. VEDA tells him\nwhat has happened in flashes.\nVEDA\nAlaa mugguram irukkupoyaamraa!\nBHANU\nNijamga nuvvem cheyaledhu kadha\nVEDA\nRey..\nBHANU\nok, ok. Mari ippudu ella...\nVEDA thinks for a while and asks SULOCHANA\nVEDA\nAvunu nuvvu poddhuna saksham\ncheppina vaallu perullu emanav...\nSULOCHANA\nINUMAYYA okadu ANTHONY anevaadu\ninkokkadu\nGOVARDHAN\nINUMAYYA!!? Naaku podhune enthuku\ncheppaledhu? Vaadu naa building\nwatchman.\nGOVARDHAN\nVaadi maatalu evvaru nammaru, vaadu\nchusedhi okati cheppedhi okati.\nGOVARDHAN now smiles, with pride and glee.\nGOVARDHAN\nNaaku antha ardham ayindhi..baga\nardham ayindhi. Padhandhi velli\npolicelu ku chepudam. Vadu oka\nsudha thagobothu Vedava.\nA realization dawns on him\nGOVARDHAN\nPoddhunna nenu dhebbalu thintunte\nakkade nilabadi navvuthunnadu\nrascal. Tharavaatha padipoyi\nuntaadu aatharavaatha malli lechi\ncar kalipodam chusi maname anukuni,\npoliceluhu adhe cheppuntaadu.\nPadhandi station ki veldam.\nVEDA\nMari ANTHONY aney sakshi?\nGOVARDHAN\nNaaku theleedhu\nVEDA\nSakshyam cheppina vaalani\nkalavaali. Mee iddaru ikkadey\nundandi. Nannu evvaru\ngurthupattaru, nenu vedi PS ki\nveltham.\nBHANU\nNena?\nVEDA\nAvunu nuvey\nCUT TO:",
